      "metadata": {
        "split_group": "valid_frivolous_termination"
      },
      "narrative": "The consumer wrote to the CRA saying only that \"something on my report is wrong.\" The submission did not identify an account, did not identify a disputed field, and did not explain a basis. The CRA made a frivolous-or-irrelevant determination, sent notice 3 business days later, identified the missing account and disputed information, and explained that this missing information was needed before investigation. No reinvestigation was conducted, no furnisher notice was sent, and no results notice was sent.\n",
      "provenance": "authored",
      "structured_fields": {},
      "title": "Valid frivolous termination makes reinvestigation not required"
    },
